      <Docs>
        <summary>
          <para>Category indicating the job is for performing app updates by a registered app store.</para>
          <para>This category can only be used by registered app stores (apps holding the Manifest.permission.INSTALL_PACKAGES_AS_REGISTERED_APP_STORE permission) and will throw a SecurityException otherwise.</para>
          <para>This is a hint to the system. The system may choose relaxed throttling and quota policies for the jobs marked with this category to make sure the app updates are completed in a timely manner. This may include exemption from app standby buckets, but it is not guaranteed.</para>
          <para><format type="text/html"><a href="https://developer.android.com/reference/android/app/job/JobInfo#CATEGORY_APP_UPDATES" title="Reference documentation">Android reference for <code>android.app.job.JobInfo.CATEGORY_APP_UPDATES</code>.</a></format></para>
